WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.721
The four Ps are the levers you control: product, price, place and promotion.

00:00:05.771 --> 00:00:09.490
Baxter says they haven't changed, only how we execute.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.000
Raise the price,

00:00:10.566 --> 00:00:12.886
then run constant discounts,

00:00:12.936 --> 00:00:14.914
and shoppers learn to wait for the sale.

00:00:14.964 --> 00:00:17.198
It stops feeling premium.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.067
Nike pulled back from retailers.

00:00:20.117 --> 00:00:24.658
Fewer shelves meant fewer people saw it, so place hurt promotion too.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.263
So link every P to the same target and positioning,

00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:31.061
and the whole mix sends one signal.
